        "content": "<p>Hi all, I am running into a quirk of <code>simp</code> (or what I assume to be one) which I cannot seem to be able to solve. Below is a minimized version of the code I'm working on. Most of it is just setup I need.</p>\n<p>The problem arises in the proof of <code>TopPair.Homotopy.refl.w</code> at the end of the file. (This is commutativity of a certain square in <code>TopCat</code>.) For some reason <code>simp</code> cannot use <code>TopCat.hom_comp</code> here, even though, to my eyes, it applies to the goal. In fact, I have copied the entire goal into a separate lemma <code>test</code> and <code>simp</code> is just able to prove it. I can then apply the lemma in the proof of <code>w</code> and it completes. So I don't understand why <code>simp</code> cannot complete the proof of <code>w</code> without an extra lemma. I expect that there is some Lean technicality here that causes this.</p>\n<p>If anybody has any ideas what might be the problem, I would love to hear them. Thanks!</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Comma</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Category</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Limits</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Homotopy</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Monoidal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Category</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Homotopy</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Category</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Monoidal</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalCategory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">section</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Category</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IsMultiplicative</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IsMultiplicative</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Given a morphism property `P` on a category `T`, this is the</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">subcategory of `Arrow T` defined by `P` where morphisms satisfy `Q` and `W` on the left and right,</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">respectively. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">protected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Comma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">𝟭</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">𝟭</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Make an object of `P.Arrow Q X` from a morphism `f : A ⟶ B` and a proof of `P f`. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">protected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Make a morphism in `P.Arrow Q X` from morphisms in `T` with compatibilities. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">protected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">homMk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≫</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cat_disch</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hg</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">__</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">homMk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">prop_hom_left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">prop_hom_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hg</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- A pair of topological spaces consists of a morphism f : A ⟶ X in `TopCat`</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">such that the topology of A is induced by f. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopPair</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">MorphismProperty</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Arrow</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IsInducing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hom</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊤</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopPair</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopPair</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- The first space of the pair -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">right</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- The second space of the pair -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">snd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- The map that induces the topology on A -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">snd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hom</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isInducing_map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopPair</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IsInducing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">prop</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Construct a topological pair from its components. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopCat</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span c